{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦\n云摩訶心經，一紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云\n般若心經，一紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《會要》云：『謂二乘無學已斷\n三界九地見思二惑，餘有苦依身在故。』"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《肇論》\n引云：非色敗空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《大品．習應品》文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空色殊照，故各一心。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真空幻色，本自不二。今既各說，故失不二之\n本也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牒上即色明空義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經說真空即幻色故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上非\n色是真空，下非色是斷空。不說真空是離色滅色故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離色滅色。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牒上\n非理也。若離色，唯太虗離色耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出過\n也。斷滅之空，無知無用，非修非證，何必辨明？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幻也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色空不二，為經正義。經文初句簡實\n也，次句簡斷空，後二句一念雙簡。得智用者，則事不\n異理，理不異事。事理互融，空有雙照矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真如\n之理，自性常住，無有改變，即是一切眾生本有佛性。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛性雖具，必假修習定慧之力，方能引發本有之\n性。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "老死第十二支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十一生支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十有支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第九取支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第八\n愛支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第七\n受支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第六觸支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第五六入支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第四名色支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第三識支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二行支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一無明支"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "等者，等取八正道等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下全引〈光明覺品〉疏鈔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
